CAKE dummynet scheduler built into dummynet.ko, plus ipfw(8)/dnctl(8)
parameters, display and manual.

Made against opnsense/src stable/26.7 (01510f09); apply with "git apply"
or "patch -p1" in /usr/src. Same scheduler source as
sys/netpfil/ipfw/dn_sched_cake.[ch] and the same userland change as
ipfw-cake.patch in this repository.

